<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Nokia.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Nokia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued four million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Nokai A shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	13.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  257 FIM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		 STRIKE PRICE    ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>		  275 FIM	   57.42 FIM</p>
<p>		  325 FIM	   42.51 FIM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
